ur collaborator’s contributions to various aspects of your group (for example, an individual experience). we’ll share more about our long term vision for groups in the coming months.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:81,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:2,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:137,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-10-04T20:27:32.252Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:29,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:8,\&quot;reads\&quot;:414,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:413,\&quot;score\&quot;:227.8,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2630657,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;creator-roadmap-ama-with-nick-and-tian-oct-4-2023\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;lowercasecreator\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:null,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:1,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;link_counts\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/summary-of-the-creator-roadmap-ama-oct-4-2023/2631246\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Summary of the Creator Roadmap AMA (Oct 4, 2023)\&quot;,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:1}],\&quot;read\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_title\&quot;:null,\&quot;reply_to_user\&quot;:{\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;Entelogical\&quot;,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;Entelogical\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/entelogical/{size}/9005202_2.png\&quot;},\&quot;bookmarked\&quot;:false,\&quot;actions_summary\&quot;:[{\&quot;id\&quot;:2,\&quot;count\&quot;:7}],\&quot;moderator\&quot;:false,\&quot;admin\&quot;:false,\&quot;staff\&quot;:false,\&quot;user_id\&quot;:1201265,\&quot;hidden\&quot;:false,\&quot;trust_level\&quot;:1,\&quot;deleted_at\&quot;:null,\&quot;user_deleted\&quot;:false,\&quot;edit_reason\&quot;:null,\&quot;can_view_edit_history\&quot;:false,\&quot;wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;post_url\&quot;:\&quot;/t/creator-roadmap-ama-with-nick-and-tian-oct-4-2023/2630657/81\&quot;,\&quot;can_accept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_unaccept_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_accepted_answer\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_translate\&quot;:false,\&quot;is_translated\&quot;:false,\&quot;detected_language\&quot;:null},{\&quot;id\&quot;:9752094,\&quot;name\&quot;:\&quot;Polaris\&quot;,\&quot;username\&quot;:\&quot;PolarisWasInDenial\&quot;,\&quot;avatar_template\&quot;:\&quot;/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/polariswasindenial/{size}/8845758_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-10-04T20:29:00.959Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003cp\\u003eHonestly, the single most useful thing for UI, in my opinion, would be SVG support. It’d solve a lot of issues with scalability and provide an easy route for people already experienced with UI/UX design to easily do work on Roblox, while also allowing for a way to use custom fonts made by creators. As much as I desperately want acrylic/blur effects available for UI elements, I feel that SVG support would be the biggest long-term improvement one could make to Roblox’s image support and UI functionality.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:83,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:137,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-10-04T20:29:00.959Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:78,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:1,\&quot;reads\&quot;:387,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:386,\&quot;score\&quot;:112.4,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2630657,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;creator-roadmap-ama-with-nick-and-tian-oct-4-2023\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\