ng\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-10-04T20:30:14.651Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003caside class=\\\&quot;quote group-Roblox_Staff\\\&quot; data-username=\\\&quot;skywise84\\\&quot; data-post=\\\&quot;78\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;2630657\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cimg alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/skywise84/60/7341696_2.png\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;avatar\\\&quot;\\u003e NickT:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf you could wave a magic wand, what one improvement would you like most?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIn terms of UI, I’d personally most like to see being able to invert UI elements using negative size to see a mirrored version of it, especially in the case of ViewportFrames.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eI’m looking forward to other visual effects, but I think I’m most interested in that one at this moment.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003caside class=\\\&quot;quote group-Roblox_Staff\\\&quot; data-username=\\\&quot;skywise84\\\&quot; data-post=\\\&quot;73\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;2630657\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cimg alt=\\\&quot;\\\&quot; width=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; height=\\\&quot;24\\\&quot; src=\\\&quot;https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/skywise84/60/7341696_2.png\\\&quot; class=\\\&quot;avatar\\\&quot;\\u003e NickT:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIf you have any specific asks around what type of controls you’d like to see, we’d love to hear it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eThe main improvement I’d like to see for terrain is being able to adjust the properties of grass/water, and preferably all terrain, non-globally.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eAdditionally, I’d like to see terrain water work as a material that you can apply to a part. This would be incredibly useful, especially if that part can have unique water properties.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eI would ask the same for decoration like grass being able to be applied to parts, but water is more important for me right now.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&quot;post_number\&quot;:84,\&quot;post_type\&quot;:1,\&quot;posts_count\&quot;:137,\&quot;updated_at\&quot;:\&quot;2023-10-04T20:30:14.651Z\&quot;,\&quot;reply_count\&quot;:0,\&quot;reply_to_post_number\&quot;:78,\&quot;quote_count\&quot;:2,\&quot;incoming_link_count\&quot;:7,\&quot;reads\&quot;:387,\&quot;readers_count\&quot;:386,\&quot;score\&quot;:127.4,\&quot;yours\&quot;:false,\&quot;topic_id\&quot;:2630657,\&quot;topic_slug\&quot;:\&quot;creator-roadmap-ama-with-nick-and-tian-oct-4-2023\&quot;,\&quot;display_username\&quot;:\&quot;Fate\&quot;,\&quot;primary_group_name\&quot;:null,\&quot;flair_name\&quot;:\&quot;Game_Designers\&quot;,\&quot;flair_url\&quot;:\&quot;gamepad\&quot;,\&quot;flair_bg_color\&quot;:\&quot;00C4AD\&quot;,\&quot;flair_color\&quot;:\&quot;fff\&quot;,\&quot;flair_group_id\&quot;:113,\&quot;badges_granted\&quot;:[],\&quot;version\&quot;:1,\&quot;can_edit\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_delete\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_recover\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_see_hidden_post\&quot;:false,\&quot;can_wiki\&quot;:false,\&quot;link_counts\&quot;:[{\&quot;url\&quot;:\&quot;https://devforum.roblox.com/t/grass-is-getting-greener-on-this-side-grasslength-studio-beta/2632753/18\&quot;,\&quot;internal\&quot;:true,\&quot;reflection\&quot;:true,\&quot;title\&quot;:\&quot;Grass is getting greener on this side! [GrassLength Studio Beta]\&quot;,\&quot;clicks\&quot;:0}],\&quot;read\&quot;:true,\&quot;user_title\&quot;: